UID:jWilwKBseMBVoTBQ9t9hf
SUMMARY:Raja 50: Ilaiyaraaja Live In Concert at Smart Financial Centre
DTSTAMP:20260816T033421Z
DTSTART:20260816T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Ilaiyaraaja—the legendary India
	n film composer “Isaignani\,” renowned for blending Carnatic\, folk\, and 
	Western symphonic music—and his Raja 50 concert to the Sugar Land stage. \
	nBeyond the National Film Awards\, he has also received India’s highest na
	tional cultural and civilian honors: Padma Vibushan in 2018 and Padma Bhus
	han in 2010. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $92. Order tickets or learn mor
	e. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organize
	r and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more a
	bout promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all 
	of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/raja-50-ilaiy
	araaja-live-in-concert-at-smart-financial-centre/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do
	 in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/raja-50-ilaiyaraaja-live-in-con
	cert-at-smart-financial-centre/
LOCATION:Smart Financial Centre at Sugar Land\, 18111 Lexington Blvd\, Suga
	r Land\, TX\, 77479\, United States
