UID:9GWk4G7sJ9jcmIhlNUB6k
SUMMARY:Eureka Heights 10th Birthday Party at Eureka Heights Brew Co.
DTSTAMP:20260816T033421Z
DTSTART:20260818T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Eureka Heights Brew Co. celebrates a decade of craft brewing wi
	th a full week of events from Tuesday\, August 18 to Sunday\, August 23—wi
	th the main event 10th Birthday Party happening on on Saturday\, August 22
	\,2026. \n10th Birthday Party\nThe 10th Birthday Party features anniversar
	y beers\, live entertainment\, food\, and brewery festivities. \nAdmission
	 is free\, with optional VIP tickets offering early entry from 10am to noo
	n\, unlimited draft beer during VIP hours\, a commemorative anniversary gl
	ass\, kolaches and coffee\, first access to anniversary beer and merchandi
	se\, unlimited pinball\, and more. \nGet advance VIP tickets. \nBirthday W
	eek Schedule\n\n\nHigh Five Society Member Appreciation Night | Tuesday\, 
	August 18\nEureka Heights Trivia Night | Wednesday\, August 19\n10 Years o
	f Laces Out Run Club | Thursday\, August 20\nEureka Heights Garage Sale | 
	Friday\, August 21\n10th Birthday Party | Saturday\, August 22\nPost Party
	 by Eureka Chill | Sunday\, August 23\n\n\nAdmission\nNo cover\; VIP ticke
	ts with loads of extras for $65+. Learn more or get VIP tickets. \n \nThis
	 Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and booste
	d in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoti
	ng your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our chann
	els. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/eureka-heights-10th-birth
	day-party/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/eureka-heights-10th-birthday-pa
	rty/
LOCATION:Eureka Heights Brew Co.\, 941 W 18th St\, Houston\, TX\, 77008\, U
	nited States
