SUMMARY:Candlelight Concert: Coldplay & Imagine Dragons at Resurrection MCC
DTSTAMP:20260816T033421Z
DTSTART:20260822T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:Fever presents Candlelight: Coldplay & Imagine Dragons by the L
	isteso String Quartet at Resurrection MCC in the Heights. \nThe live\, 60-
	minute\, multi-sensory string musical experience will showcase Coldplay hi
	ts like “Clocks” and “Fix You” and Imagine Dragon’s favorites like “Radioa
	ctive” and “Eyes Closed”—all performed under the gentle glow of candleligh
	t. \nFuture dates available. \nCandlelight Concert Series\nThe performance
	 is a Fever Original and part of the ongoing Candlelght Concert Series hap
	pening around Houston every week. \nSee upcoming Candlelight concerts from
	 Fever \nAdmission\nTickets are $28.50 and up\, but may fluctuate based on
	 demand. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nIf you make a purchase followin
	g links to Fever in this calendar listing\, you’re supporting 365 Houston 
	and our staff and contributors. We may receive a small commission from Fev
	er on any purchase you make—at no additional cost to you. \nLearn more abo
	ut advertising your event\, business\, product or service.\n\nhttps://365t
	hingsinhouston.com/calendar/candlelight-concert-coldplay-imagine-dragons-a
	t-resurrection-mcc-4/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
